            "liquid": "<div class=\"sor-reviews\" id=\"sor-reviews\">\n  <div class=\"sor-review-slide active\" data-slide=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"sor-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-name\">Lucia, 41 jaar | Overgang</div>\n    <p class=\"sor-review-text\">\"Na 7 dagen knelde mijn ring 's ochtends niet meer en was mijn gezicht minder gezwollen. 's Avonds voelen mijn benen <strong>lichter</strong> aan, en ik hoef niet meer om de 10 minuten naar het toilet. Eindelijk voel ik me <strong>comfortabel in mijn kleding</strong>.\"</p>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-verified\">\n      <span class=\"sor-verified-check\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      Geverifieerde aankoop\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-review-slide\" data-slide=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"sor-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-name\">Carla, 36 jaar | Zware benen</div>\n    <p class=\"sor-review-text\">\"Mijn enkels zijn <strong>de helft dunner</strong> geworden. Een echt verschil bij het wakker worden en vooral als ik thuiskom van werk: ik voel me <strong>minder opgezwollen</strong> en <strong>minder afgekneld</strong>.\"</p>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-verified\">\n      <span class=\"sor-verified-check\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      Geverifieerde aankoop\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-review-slide\" data-slide=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"sor-review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-name\">Marta, 48 jaar | Vocht vasthouden</div>\n    <p class=\"sor-review-text\">\"Ik ben in een paar weken <strong>meer dan 10 cm kwijtgeraakt</strong> rond mijn bovenbenen en billen. Voor een 100% natuurlijke oplossing zonder moeite had ik dit <strong>nooit verwacht</strong>.\"</p>\n    <div class=\"sor-review-verified\">\n      <span class=\"sor-verified-check\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      Geverifieerde aankoop\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sor-review-dots\">\n    <button class=\"sor-dot active\" data-goto=\"0\" aria-label=\"Review 1\"></button>\n    <button class=\"sor-dot\" data-goto=\"1\" aria-label=\"Review 2\"></button>\n    <button class=\"sor-dot\" data-goto=\"2\" aria-label=\"Review 3\"></button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.sor-reviews{\n  font-family:inherit;\n  max-width:100%;\n  position:relative;\n  margin-top:24px;\n}\n.sor-review-slide{\n  display:none;\n  background:#F7F6F3;\n  border:1px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius:14px;\n  padding:22px 18px;\n}\n.sor-review-slide.active{display:block;}\n.sor-review-stars{\n  color:#E8A93B;\n  font-size:16px;\n  letter-spacing:2px;\n  margin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.sor-review-name{\n  font-weight:700;\n  font-size:15px;\n  color:#1a1a1a;\n  margin-bottom:12px;\n}\n.sor-review-text{\n  font-size:14px;\n  line-height:1.55;\n  color:#1a1a1a;\n  margin:0 0 16px;\n}\n.sor-review-text strong{font-weight:700;}\n.sor-review-verified{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  gap:8px;\n  font-weight:700;\n  font-size:13.5px;\n  color:#5C8A5C;\n}\n.sor-verified-check{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  width:20px;\n  height:20px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  background:#5C8A5C;\n  flex-shrink:0;\n}\n.sor-review-dots{\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:center;\n  gap:8px;\n  margin-top:16px;\n}\n.sor-dot{\n  width:8px;\n  height:8px;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  border:none;\n  background:#D9D5CE;\n  padding:0;\n  cursor:pointer;\n}\n.sor-dot.active{background:#1a1a1a;}\n\n@media (min-width:750px){\n  .sor-review-name{font-size:17px;}\n  .sor-review-text{font-size:16px;}\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('sor-reviews');\n  if(!root) return;\n  var slides = root.querySelectorAll('.sor-review-slide');\n  var dots = root.querySelectorAll('.sor-dot');\n  dots.forEach(function(dot){\n    dot.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var i = parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-goto'), 10);\n      slides.forEach(function(s, idx){ s.classList.toggle('active', idx === i); });\n      dots.forEach(function(d, idx){ d.classList.toggle('active', idx === i); });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>"
